                <pb facs="0341" n="253" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg253"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Squiers to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-12-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bill alloting $190,000 for sanitation of Santiago and other cities passed House
                    yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
